/u/52577744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthiasBae","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-26T23:59:02Z","updated_at":"2025-09-26T23:59:02Z","body":"> We can't help you without an MRP that can reproduce the before and after. As is, there isn't enough information for us to meaningfully investigate anything. \n\n1. Which information would you need? I could try to get some by testing myself. \n2. I know it is not an MRP because my project has grown a lot but I could provide it (if it is fine for debugging). If yes, i will prepare it and attach it in here.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340828890/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340894633","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110945#issuecomment-3340894633","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110945","id":3340894633,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HIgGp","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T00:44:25Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T00:44:25Z","body":"What we need is something that we can run both before and after to see what is taking up the most time. That way we can measure the difference before and after and figure out what system is slowing down your project. \n\nAttaching your project is fine if you want to share it, but it needs to be small enough that a contributor can reasonably open it up, run it and experience the performance issue that you have reported. If the project requires any more than that, then I doubt anyone will be willing to take a look","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3340894633/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341211326","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110945#issuecomment-3341211326","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110945","id":3341211326,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HJta-","user":{"login":"MatthiasBae","id":52577744,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNTc3NzQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52577744?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae","html_url":"https://github.com/MatthiasBae","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MatthiasBae/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-27T05:18:07Z","updated_at":"2025-09-27T10:13:38Z","body":"> What we need is something that we can run both before and after to see what is taking up the most time. That way we can measure the difference before and after and figure out what system is slowing down your project.\n> \n> Attaching your project is fine if you want to share it, but it needs to be small enough that a contributor can reasonably open it up, run it and experience the performance issue that you have reported. If the project requires any more than that, then I doubt anyone will be willing to take a look\n\nSo, i stripped down my project as much as possible, I also changed the textures and I get the exact results again. It does not differ between 4.4.1 and 4.5\n\nMy project has been migrated from stable 4.4 to a custom 4.4 (later custom 4.4.1) and then later again to stable 4.5.\n\n[PerformanceSlow (2).zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22571050/PerformanceSlow.2.zip)\n[Performance Fast.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22571042/Performance.Fast.zip)\n\nFor uploading I had to delete the .godot folder in the slow project but it did not affect the performance on my side.\n\n**My old project has about 80 - 90 FPS by doing nothing and just standing still.**\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee9b1921-184c-49c8-9200-6e519773ea6f\n\n**The fresh setup project gets around 310 FPS. Also doing nothing.** \n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e8e16c92-1ed3-40f3-aa0c-a646cfa2365a\n\nBecause nothing changed I guess there is something wrong with the renderer as the debugger (If I understand correctly) shows more ms for rendering viewport than in the new project.\n\nI attached the MRPs in here, also add them to my issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341211326/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3341439842","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110945#issuecomment-3341439842","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110945","id":3341439842,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7HKlNi","user":{"login":"game009f","id":80683955,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwNjgzOTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/80683955?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/game009f","html_url":"https://github.com/game009f","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/game009f/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/game009f/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/game009f/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/game009f/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/game009f/subscriptions","organiza